  Scenario: Happy path
    When the bridge is set up to accept the peg-in transaction
    And  I POST "/accept-pegin" with
      | blockHash        | 0x0000000000000000000282fa21665766e58eb6cb94e458c3ef6d4af1121e38d9     |
      | amount0          | 99365                                                                  |
      | scriptPubKey0    | 0x51209687ca13c4fb3fa3ba05c2f9119dda026bfe66f0098dcf9b896a98ecb2e96702 |
      | amount1          | 300                                                                    |
      | scriptPubKey1    | 0x0014298a0fe992f755152a81ee64bdc4cc96d3bb8969                         |
      | txId             | 0x8264f7a960bc2f030c740ff08089b202adb73b820a3d7e174edc7626806905bf     |
      | merkleHashBranch | 0x3fcef4a1ddf759a858190b89ecbd1ff3dffb49704e110b68baf5b5de7021910f     |
    Then the response code is "200"
    And  the response should contain a valid transaction hash

